{"The spans.buffer.flusher.wait_produce metric timer uses tag key 'shards' (plural) while all other metrics in the same function use 'shard' (singular), causing inconsistent metric grouping and breaking dashboard consistency": 0.8746479749679565, "SpanFlusher.join(timeout=...) can break out of its per-process loop once the deadline expires, leaving remaining flusher processes running after join returns, which can leak background processes during shutdown/rebalancing": 0.9606044292449951, "If --flusher-processes is set to a negative integer, SpanFlusher computes a negative num_processes and crashes while distributing shards because process_to_shards_map is empty but process_index resolves to 0, causing a KeyError": 0.48464590311050415}